This repository is a deployment note overlay.

- FastLLM upstream: https://github.com/ztxz16/fastllm (Apache-2.0)
- vLLM 0.2 upstream: https://github.com/weicj/vLLM-2080Ti-Definitive (Apache-2.0)

Measurement notes and host scripts in this overlay are provided as-is for
reproducing the dual RTX 2080 Ti 22GB + NVLink Docker setup.
